[{"id":748,"name":"AlphaRAR.attainableSet","kind":"Definition","keyword":"def","module":"AlphaRAR.YDK2026.ResponseConsistency","package":"AlphaRAR","isProp":false,"hashes":{"meaning":"4030079547227b3f","local":"363b2dfc324754a5","content":"bfcc7e50aea71cd5"},"doc":"**Attainable set of the estimator.** The closure of all values `θ̂_{n,k}(ω)` of the sequential\nestimator for arm `k`, over times `n` and outcomes `ω`. Every pointwise limit of `θ̂_{·,k}` lies\nin it (`estimator_limit_mem_attainableSet`), so Condition **B**'s positivity requirement on this\nset transfers to the plug-in-target limit `u_k = T(z)_k`. ","statement":{"binders":[{"explicit":false,"implicit":true,"name":"Ω","role":"type","type":"Type u_1","typeRefs":[]},{"explicit":false,"implicit":true,"name":"𝓐","role":"type","type":"Type u_2","typeRefs":[]},{"explicit":true,"implicit":false,"name":"A","role":"variable","type":"ℕ → Ω → 𝓐","typeRefs":[[0,1,"Nat"]]},{"explicit":true,"implicit":false,"name":"Y","role":"variable","type":"ℕ → Ω → ℝ","typeRefs":[[0,1,"Nat"],[8,9,"Real"]]},{"explicit":true,"head":"Real","implicit":false,"name":"θ₀","role":"variable","type":"ℝ","typeRefs":[[0,1,"Real"]]},{"explicit":true,"implicit":false,"name":"k","role":"variable","type":"𝓐","typeRefs":[]}],"conclusion":"Set ℝ","conclusionHead":"Set","conclusionRefs":[[0,3,"Set"],[4,5,"Real"]],"decl":"AlphaRAR.attainableSet","value":"closure\n  (Set.range fun p =>\n    estimator (fun j => Learning.actionIndicator A k j p.2) (fun x => Y x p.2) θ₀ p.1)","valueRefs":[[0,7,"closure"],[11,20,"Set.range"],[34,43,"AlphaRAR.estimator"],[54,78,"Learning.actionIndicator"]]},"code":"/-- **Attainable set of the estimator.** The closure of all values `θ̂_{n,k}(ω)` of the sequential\nestimator for arm `k`, over times `n` and outcomes `ω`. Every pointwise limit of `θ̂_{·,k}` lies\nin it (`estimator_limit_mem_attainableSet`), so Condition **B**'s positivity requirement on this\nset transfers to the plug-in-target limit `u_k = T(z)_k`. -/\ndef attai